From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Varun Gupta <varun.gupta@intel.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Jun 2026 00:00:02 +0530
Subject: drm/xe: build xe_svm.o under CONFIG_DRM_GPUSVM

In backport targets where full Xe SVM is gated, `xe_svm.o` still provides
the drm_gpusvm-backed userptr runtime path. Build `xe_svm.o` under
`CONFIG_DRM_GPUSVM` so it stays aligned with `xe_userptr.o` availability.

v1: Rebase to v7.3 kernel [Raju]

Signed-off-by: Varun Gupta <varun.gupta@intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Kanaka Raju Nayana <kanaka.raju.nayana@intel.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/xe/Makefile | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/Makefile b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/Makefile
index 9ab5a42..88ca3c6 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/Makefile
@@ -163,7 +163,7 @@ xe-$(CONFIG_I2C)	+= xe_i2c.o \
 xe-$(CONFIG_PRELIM_DRM_XE_EUDEBUG) += prelim/xe_eudebug.o \
 		prelim/xe_debug_metadata.o \
 		prelim/xe_eudebug_pagefault.o
-xe-$(CONFIG_DRM_XE_GPUSVM) += xe_svm.o
+xe-$(CONFIG_DRM_GPUSVM) += xe_svm.o
 xe-$(CONFIG_DRM_GPUSVM) += xe_userptr.o
 
 # graphics hardware monitoring (HWMON) support
